13
00:00:59,007 --> 00:01:03,176
Transcription — Transcription produces RNA from a DNA gene.

14
00:01:03,176 --> 00:01:08,476
Translation — Translation uses mRNA codons and ribosomes to build proteins.

15
00:01:08,476 --> 00:01:14,200
Mutation and gene expression evidence — Mutations and expression patterns connect

16
